        "thought_text": "Thought-2: The code incorrectly prints only the efficiency gap because the `results` list containing the per-district output strings is populated but never iterated over or printed before the final efficiency gap calculation. The fix requires adding a loop to print each element in `results` before printing the efficiency gap.",
